# --- v3.0: the constants the structure wave found beside their code (v30 ST0) ----------------------------------
# Each is also editable in Admin › Constants unless noted (UPLOAD_MAX_MB is .env only).
# AI_TASK_KEEP_DAYS=30
# AI_USAGE_KEEP_DAYS=35
# EXTENSION_TOKENS_PER_ACCOUNT=10
# EXTENSION_TOKEN_KEEP_DAYS=30
# MCP_REPORTS_KEPT=200
# JOB_ANALYSIS_PER_ACCOUNT_PER_HOUR=20
# QUEUE_TOMBSTONE_KEEP_DAYS=30
# AUTOFILL_AI_PER_HOUR=200
# AUTOFILL_DRAFTS_PER_DAY=300
# AUTOFILL_COVER_LETTERS_PER_HOUR=60
# SAVED_SEARCHES_MAX=50
# SAVE_ALL_RUNS_PER_HOUR=20
# JOB_SOURCE_RUN_KEEP_DAYS=90
# UPLOAD_MAX_MB=5
# UPLOAD_BATCH_MAX_FILES=50
# MSG_EXTENSION_TOKENS_MAX=This account already has {max} connected browsers, the most TailorIT allows. Disconnect one in Settings › Autofill, then connect again.
# MSG_PHOTO_TOO_LARGE=That photo is larger than {max_mb} MB. Choose a smaller image.
# MSG_AI_BUSY=An AI request of this kind is already running for your account. Wait for it to finish, then try again.
# MSG_AI_CANCELLED=This AI request was cancelled.
# MSG_AI_INTERRUPTED=The server restarted while this AI request was running. Please try again.
# MSG_RESUME_IMPORT_MAX=A file can hold at most {max} resumes.
# MSG_UPLOAD_BATCH_MAX=Up to {max} files can be uploaded at a time, so {left_out} {left_out|file was|files were} not added.
# MSG_LETTER_BEING_WRITTEN=This cover letter is being written. Wait for it to finish, then try again.
# MSG_SAVED_SEARCHES_MAX=You can keep up to {max} saved searches. Delete one to save this search.
# MSG_SIGN_INS_MAX=You can save up to {max} job-site sign-ins. Delete one you no longer use first.
# MSG_SAVED_ANSWERS_MAX=You have saved {max} answers, the most TailorIT keeps. Delete some on Settings › Autofill › Saved answers, then save this one again.
# MSG_AUTOFILL_RESUME_TOO_LARGE=This resume's file is larger than {max_mb} MB, more than the extension can attach. Choose another resume, or make this one smaller.
# MSG_SIGN_IN_CODE_COOLDOWN=A code was just sent to that address. Wait {seconds} more {seconds|second|seconds} before asking for another, and check the spam folder in the meantime.
# MSG_SIGN_IN_CODE_EXPIRED=That code has expired. Ask for a new one.
# MSG_SIGN_IN_CODE_ATTEMPTS=That code was entered wrongly {max} times and is no longer valid. Ask for a new one.
# MSG_CONNECT_CODE_EXPIRED=That code has expired or was already used. Get a new one from Settings › Autofill.
# MSG_INGEST_IMPORT_RUNNING=This import is running. Wait for it to finish.
# MSG_INGEST_SOURCE_RUNNING=This source is already running. Wait for that run to finish.
# MSG_INGEST_SOURCE_RUNNING_DELETE=This source is running. Wait for the run to finish, then delete it.
# MSG_SHEET_ROWS_MAX=This tab has more than {max} rows below the header row. Split it into tabs of up to {max} rows and import each one.
# MSG_SHEET_TOO_LARGE=This tab holds more than {max_mb} MB of text. Split it into smaller tabs and import each one.
# LABEL_JOB_CLOSED=No longer accepting applications
# LABEL_JOB_LIVE=Confirmed live in the last 24 hours
# end v3.0 ST0
# v3.0 ST4
# MSG_SHEET_ANSWER_TOO_LARGE=This tab is too large to import at once (Google sent more than {size}). Split it into smaller tabs and import each one.
# end v3.0 ST4
# v30 ST1: the resume ZIP's statuses and the letter template's AI prompt cap.
# MSG_ZIP_ALREADY_BUILDING=Your resumes are already being built. Wait for that download to finish, then try again.
# MSG_ZIP_STILL_BUILDING=Your resumes are still being built. Download them once they are ready.
# MSG_ZIP_STOPPED=Building your resumes was stopped because the server is restarting. Please try again.
# MSG_ZIP_GONE=That zip is no longer available. Build your resumes again.
# MSG_ZIP_NOT_MADE=That zip could not be made. Build your resumes again.
# MSG_ZIP_SERVER_BUSY=TailorIT is building another zip of resumes right now. Please try again in {seconds} {seconds|second|seconds}.
# MSG_ZIP_TOO_LARGE=These resumes add up to more than {max_mb} MB. Select fewer {items} and try again.
# MSG_TEMPLATE_AI_PROMPT_TOO_LONG=The AI prompt can be at most {max} characters.
# end v30 ST1
# v3.0 ST3: added with their adoption (autofill, jobs, sign-in).
# MSG_SAVE_ALL_PER_HOUR=Save all can run {max} {max|time|times} an hour. Please wait {minutes} {minutes|minute|minutes} and try again.
# MSG_SAVE_ALL_BUSY=Save all is still working on your last request. Wait a moment and try again.
# MSG_AUTOFILL_LETTER_TOO_LARGE=This cover letter's PDF is larger than {max_mb} MB, more than the extension can attach.
# MSG_AUTOFILL_NOTE_TOO_LONG=With the lines this connection keeps hidden (they state sensitive answers), the note would be over {max} characters. Shorten it, or edit it on the Settings › Autofill page in TailorIT.
# MSG_QUEUE_JOB_NOT_RUNNING=This auto-apply job is not running any more: it was finished or removed. Ask for the next one.
# MSG_QUEUE_JOB_NOT_YOURS=Another browser is running this auto-apply job. Only that browser reports how it went.
# MSG_QUEUE_JOB_APPLYING=The extension is applying to this job now. Wait for its result, or stop auto-apply in the extension, then remove it.
# MSG_QUEUE_JOB_TAKEN=Another auto-apply run (the background agent, or another browser) has this job now. Open the next queued one.
# MSG_QUEUE_JOB_FINISHED=This auto-apply job is finished. Open the next queued one, or queue it again in TailorIT.
# MSG_SIGN_IN_CODE_USED=That code has already been used, or none was sent to this address. Ask for a new one.
# end v3.0 ST3
# --- v3.0: the web's limit and status sentences (v30 ST5) ---------------------------------------------------------
