# MSG_UPLOAD_HINT=PDF, DOC, DOCX up to {max_mb} MB each. Up to {max} files at a time.
# MSG_UPLOAD_SIZE_HINT=Up to {max_mb} MB.
# MSG_UPLOAD_TILE_HINT=PDF or Word, up to {max_mb} MB
# MSG_SECTION_ENTRIES_MAX=A section holds {max} entries at most
# MSG_CUSTOM_SECTIONS_MAX=A resume can have at most {max} custom sections.
# MSG_ENTRY_BULLETS_MAX=An entry holds {max} bullets at most
# MSG_SIGN_IN_CODE_SENT=A code was already sent to {email}. Enter it below, or wait {seconds} {seconds|second|seconds} to ask for another.
# MSG_CSV_ROWS_MAX=That file has more than {max} rows. Split it and import the parts one at a time.
# MSG_JOB_GONE=This job is no longer available
# MSG_JOB_GONE_DETAIL=It may have been taken down, or the link is out of date.
